---
import StickyNote from './StickyNote.astro';
---
<section class="board" aria-label="Working principles">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">The way I work</p>
    <h2>Not decoration. <em>Diagnosis.</em></h2>

    <div class="board-grid">
      <StickyNote color="yellow" rotate={-3}>
        <strong>Start where it hurts.</strong>
        <p>Every case study begins with a screen a real user got stuck on. Not a mood board.</p>
      </StickyNote>

      <StickyNote color="pink" rotate={2}>
        <strong>Evidence, not opinion.</strong>
        <p>Session recordings, funnel drops, support tickets. Show the receipts before the redesign.</p>
      </StickyNote>

      <StickyNote color="blue" rotate={-1.5}>
        <strong>Small pieces, tested loud.</strong>
        <p>Ship the smallest change that answers the question. Measure before you scale it up.</p>
      </StickyNote>

      <StickyNote color="green" rotate={3}>
        <strong>Design in the open.</strong>
        <p>Engineers, PMs, support all in the same doc. The best critique comes from outside the design team.</p>
      </StickyNote>

      <StickyNote color="yellow" rotate={-2}>
        <strong>Kill your darlings.</strong>
        <p>If a beautiful pattern loses to a boring one on the metric that matters, boring wins. Every time.</p>
      </StickyNote>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .board {
    padding-block: 6rem;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 20% 0%, rgba(224,90,43,0.06), transparent 40%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 90% 100%, rgba(74,124,89,0.06), transparent 40%),
      var(--paper-2);
    border-block: 1px solid var(--rule);
    position: relative;
  }
  .board::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0,0,0,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 24px 24px;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }
  h2 { max-width: 20ch; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  h2 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--accent); }

  .board-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: start;
    justify-items: center;
    position: relative;
  }
  .board-grid :global(.sticky) { width: 100%; }
  .board-grid :global(.sticky p) { margin-top: 0.5rem; }
  .board-grid :global(.sticky strong) { font-size: var(--step-1); font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 500; }
</style>
